  <div data-lys aria-label=\"Riverbank greenhouse lighting pilot: decision slide\">
    <article id=\"next-step\" aria-labelledby=\"slide-title\" data-notes=\"Recommend authorizing one more measurement cycle before considering wider installation. The pilot covered 18 greenhouse plots at three sites over one winter growing cycle. Its reported median yield difference versus each site's reference plots was +6%; individual plot differences ranged from −3% to +14%, and 12 of 18 plots were positive while six were not. Because plots were not randomly assigned and crop mix and baseline conditions differed between sites, this is an observed association, not evidence that lighting caused the difference. Installation cost and energy use were not measured; include both in the next evidence base before any wider installation decision.\">
